  "limitations": [
    "Architecture and analytical study; no indoor PNT, sensor adapter or UWB integration is implemented or qualified by this manuscript.",
    "Existing finite relative PPS observations do not establish GNSS time-transfer equivalence, calibrated UTC, independently measured electrical output or UWB differential anchor-clock performance.",
    "All source outages, invalids, missingness and eligible tails retain their population scope. Stable-window metrics are a subset.",
    "UWB TWR event alignment is a proposed first integration; fine TDoA requires independently qualified differential synchronization and spatial geometry.",
